** Probe: the v26135 RLINE barrier keywords. SBARRIER is a free-standing
** barrier: "barid STA nseg", one "barid xbb ybb xbe ybe ht z" card per
** segment (2 < ht <= 12, z must be 0), "barid END". VBARRIER takes
** eight or thirteen fields (one or two vegetative barriers; height
** 2-10, width 2.5-13, LAI 4-10.92, mixing length 0.55-3.75). RBARRIER
** takes two or four values, RDEPRESS exactly three. All need ALPHA and
** FLAT (E198 / E713). RLEMCONV is a bare keyword.
CO STARTING
   TITLEONE  oracle 18: SBARRIER VBARRIER RBARRIER RDEPRESS RLEMCONV
   MODELOPT  CONC  FLAT  ALPHA
   AVERTIME  1
   POLLUTID  OTHER
   RUNORNOT  NOT
CO FINISHED

SO STARTING
   RLEMCONV
   LOCATION  BASE  RLINEXT   0.0   -100.0    1.0     0.0   100.0     1.0     0.0
   SRCPARAM  BASE           1.0      0.0       3.6       2.0
   RBARRIER  BASE  10.0  10.0  6.0  -8.0
   RDEPRESS  BASE  -12.5  50.0  25.0
   VBARRIER  BASE  5.0  5.0  8.0  6.0  1.0  4.0  4.0  -8.0  5.0  1.2
   SBARRIER  WALL1  STA  2
   SBARRIER  WALL1  -50.0  10.0  50.0  10.0  4.0  0.0
   SBARRIER  WALL1   50.0  10.0  60.0  30.0  4.0  0.0
   SBARRIER  WALL1  END
   SRCGROUP  ALL
SO FINISHED

RE STARTING
   DISCCART  500.0  500.0  0.0
RE FINISHED

